# A reader of a merge copy by a path, in a native program: is its word kept when the root publishes the copy?  Entry 7.
Src:
    k:
        int: q 1
    end: k
end: Src
Copy: merge: Src
fn: copy_read () int
    return: Copy\k\q
end: copy_read
fn: src_read () int
    return: Src\k\q
end: src_read
int: code 7
if: copy_read() != 1
    code: 11
---
if: code = 7 && src_read() != 1
    code: 12
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
